<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia wage rise outcomes too high-Reith.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia wage rise outcomes too high-Reith.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Industrial Relations Minister Peter Reith said on Wednesday new enterprise bargaining data showed wage increases too high for a low inflation environment.</p>
</text>
